<?php
return ['name' => 'empowered_ding_fire_the_radiant', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Empowered Ding Fire – The Radiant', 'zh' => '身强丁火'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Empowered Ding Fire is like the flame of a candle—warm and bright. When at full strength, its fire burns intensely, with a focused glow that can pierce through darkness. Its power isn\'t just about illuminating the path ahead; it\'s also about persistently and purposefully radiating light and warmth over time. The Radiant ultimately learns the wisdom that \'a single spark can set a prairie ablaze, but it can also burn itself out.\' This means learning to manage your energy and passion for the long haul, rather than exhausting yourself in short, intense bursts. By embracing this balance, Empowered Ding Fire transforms its fiery intensity into a sustainable beacon of insight—one that shines brilliantly while also gently warming and inspiring those around it.</p><p>Decisive & Pioneering: You act with sharp decisiveness and strong goal orientation, driven by a pioneering spirit and a desire to lead new ventures.<br/>Quick-Witted: Creative and mentally agile, you generate ideas swiftly. Even when making major decisions, you\'re willing to consider others\' input to refine your judgment.<br/>Passionate & Loyal: Though you appear strong and bold, you are deeply sentimental and value loyalty. When major challenges arise, you can summon extraordinary energy to overcome obstacles, especially if it means protecting or supporting those you care about.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Metal, Water, Earth. You have abundant energy, but you may sometimes become overly exuberant or emotionally volatile. By harnessing the grounding power of Metal, Water, and Earth, you can steady your flame. These energies help stabilize your fire, channeling your passion into more structured action and making it easier to achieve concrete results without burning out.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>You do best financially by leveraging your personal skills or building a strong technical niche. In other words, create value through your craftsmanship or expertise. Your income can come in big bursts, but money also tends to go out quickly. Learn to hit the brakes and avoid impulsive risks. By investing in tangible assets (like real estate or patented technology) or using controlled leverage, you set yourself up for wealth that grows with age. Remember not to chase get-rich-quick schemes – slow and steady wins the race, and your fortune will snowball over time.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Take care of your liver and gallbladder by avoiding overly greasy or spicy foods. You should also watch out for sudden blood pressure fluctuations; keeping a regular routine and managing stress will help maintain emotional and physical equilibrium. Overall, maintain a balanced metabolism and avoid overworking yourself. Regular exercise and ample rest are key – be mindful not to run yourself ragged, no matter how passionate you feel.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>You\'re prone to strong emotions, especially flashes of anger or frustration when things don\'t go as planned. It\'s important for you to find calming outlets to keep those emotions in check. Try balancing your fiery temperament through soothing activities that engage your senses: for example, scuba diving can literally immerse you in calming waters, and practicing a tea ceremony or mindful tea-making ritual can help center your mind. Embracing these calming hobbies will cool and stabilize your inner fire, preventing emotional burnouts.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Management & Law: Leadership roles where decisiveness is key, such as corporate executive positions, project management, human resources, law (attorney or judge), auditing, or compliance. These fields let you exercise authority and strategic vision. Finance: Fast-paced financial sectors like banking, securities investment, actuarial insurance, or international trade. Your boldness and quick decision-making can open up lucrative paths in finance and trading (just remember to manage risk). Technology & Engineering: Fields that combine innovation and execution, including software development, data analysis, mechanical/electrical engineering, civil engineering, or aerospace. You thrive when breaking new ground and leading technical teams to actualize big ideas. Creative & Design: Careers that benefit from vision and leadership, such as architecture, urban planning, advertising strategy, screenwriting, or product design. You can take charge of creative projects and drive them to completion, inspiring others with your passion. Entertainment & Media: The spotlight suits you. Professions like acting, TV hosting, or brand management allow you to shine, lead, and influence. You bring charisma and courage to the public eye, galvanizing audiences or teams with your enthusiasm. Where Energy Feels Drained: Energy & Power Operations: Jobs in sectors like power engineering, petrochemicals, or the solar energy industry may frustrate you with regulatory constraints and slow progress, dampening your fiery drive. Education & Training: Roles such as preschool teacher, academic instructor, or training consultant might test your patience. The pace of gradual growth in students or trainees can clash with your desire for quick, transformative action. Counseling & Social Work: Professions like psychotherapy, social work, or non-profit administration require a gentle, empathetic approach and long-term patience. Your strong, assertive style might overwhelm sensitive clients or slow organizational processes. Cultural & Archival Work: Being a writer, journalist, librarian, or archivist involves meticulous detail and often solitary, methodical work. These slow, reflective environments could feel stifling to your high-energy, action-oriented nature. Health & Wellness Services: While caring, you may find roles like traditional medicine practitioner or physical therapist limiting. These fields demand calm, consistent reassurance over bold innovation. Handicrafts & Gardening: Occupations such as floral design, artisan crafts, or horticulture require delicacy and endless patience. The quiet, repetitive nature of this work might not satisfy your urge to make a big impact quickly.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Geng Metal: Geng Metal\'s strong execution skills help you focus on goals, avoiding wasted energy and improving efficiency.</li><li>Ren Water: Ren Water helps temper your impulsiveness and provides insights for better decision-making.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Xin Metal: A detail-oriented Xin Metal partner transforms your creativity into practical wealth, solidifying your family foundation.</li><li>Gui Water: Gui Water\'s flowing nature ignites your insightfulness and melts away your stubborn tendencies.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Kobe Bryant: Legendary NBA superstar who channeled fierce determination into the \'Mamba mentality.\' He founded the Mamba Sports Foundation to inspire and support others, exemplifying passionate leadership on and off the court</li><li>Vitalik Buterin: Visionary tech entrepreneur and co-founder of Ethereum. He leveraged creativity and bold thinking to forge new paths in blockchain technology, showing how focused intensity can revolutionize an industry</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Zhou Enlai: The first Premier of modern China, famed for his unwavering dedication and clear vision. He helped establish the \'Five Principles of Peaceful Coexistence,\' demonstrating how a guiding light of wisdom and diplomacy can influence a nation\'s path</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Make a Splash: Go for a swim regularly. Immersing yourself in water is both great exercise and a way to cool and balance your fiery energy</li><li>Strategic Positioning: When using public transport, try sitting on the north side. Aligning yourself with the north (a Water direction) subtly taps into calming energy during your daily commute</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Black & Blue (Water): Deep shades like black or navy blue symbolize depth and calm. These colors help stabilize your emotions, keeping you cool and collected so you\'re not easily rattled by external events. Incorporating black or blue into your outfits or surroundings is like adding a soothing balm to your flame, ensuring your actions remain steady and deliberate.</li><li>White (Metal): Clean white or metallic gold tones enhance your focus, discipline, and determination. They help you overcome procrastination and boost efficiency, acting as a clarifying force. By adding white or gold elements around you, you streamline your energy – like sharpening a sword – which helps your plans move forward smoothly.</li><li>Yellow (Earth): The color of grounded sunshine. For Empowered Ding Fire, yellow softens excess heat, transforming fiery passion into radiant creativity and heartfelt expression. Bring yellow into your day – a scarf, fresh flowers, or golden décor – to feel calmer, steady, and glowing with purpose.</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>North (Water): Facing north taps into a flowing, wise energy that benefits your career. The northern direction can boost your chances of promotion by enhancing your authority and execution at work. When you need to make important professional decisions or want to level up in your job, orient yourself northward for a dose of wisdom and clarity.</li><li>West (Metal): The west is your direction for influential people who can help you. Western energy brings focus and support from others; facing west (or spending time in western-facing rooms) attracts mentors and allies who come to your aid at crucial moments. This support opens up a smoother road for your projects and ambitions, helping your career and endeavors progress without needless obstacles.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>丁火为烛光之火，温暖而明亮，身强时火性炽烈，光芒集中而有穿透力。它的力量不仅在于照亮眼前，更在于持久而专注地传递光与热。</p><p>果决开拓：行事锐利果断，目标导向强，具备开拓精神与领导欲。<br/>思维敏捷：富有创造力，重大决策时也能参考他人意见以优化判断。<br/>重情重义：表面强势，实则重感情，遇重大挑战时能爆发超常能量。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身强丁火，喜用神为金、水、土。身强丁火力量充足，但有时容易过于张扬或情绪波动。若能借助金、水、土的能量，就能稳住火力。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>适合靠手艺或者建立自身技术壁垒获得立身财富，年龄越大财富累积越多。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>注意肝胆健康，少吃油腻辛辣食物；警惕血压波动，保持情绪稳定；关注代谢平衡，避免过度劳累。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>容易产生愤怒等情绪，可通过潜水、茶道等活动平衡。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：精密仪器维修：精密机械、仪器设备维修、机械设计。金融交易类：证券期货、外汇、贵金属、投资理财。信息技术安全维护：网络安全、系统维护、数据库管理。中介服务类：房产中介、人才中介、商务代理。基建维护：工程建设、设备维护、基础设施。仓储管理：物流管理、仓库运营、供应链管理。物流：快递、货运、交通运输、进出口贸易。消防：消防救援、安全防护、应急管理。危机公关：公共关系、危机处理、品牌管理。法律咨询：律师、法务、法律顾问。慎重行业：服务行业：餐饮、零售、客服、服务业。创意执行：广告执行、活动策划、项目管理。餐饮：酒店、餐厅、饮品、食品。教师：教育、培训、学校、辅导。园艺师：园林设计、植物种植、花卉。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>庚金：庚金执行力强，可以引导你聚焦目标，避免空耗能量，提高执行力。</li><li>壬水：壬水能克制你的急躁，在做决策时可以参考壬水的意见，提升决策的正确度。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>辛金：辛金精明细腻，善于将你的创造力转化成实际财富，稳固家业根基。</li><li>癸水：癸水灵动，能激发你的洞察力，化解你固执的一面。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Kobe Bryant：NBA传奇球星，创立曼巴体育基金会，传递\'曼巴精神\'</li><li>Vitalik Buterin：以太坊联合创始人</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>周鸿祎：360公司创始人</li><li>周恩来：新中国首任总理，提出\'和平共处五项原则\'</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>游泳</li><li>搭乘公共交通时坐在北侧</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>黑色 / 蓝色（水）：黑色象征深邃，蓝色带来理性与冷静，二者能帮助丁火稳定情绪。</li><li>白色 / 金色（金）：白色与金色能增强专注力与执行力，帮助丁火克服拖延，提升效率。</li><li>黄色（土）：黄色系能将身强丁火将过多的光和热转化为创造力与表达欲。</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>北方（水）：北方的能量象征流动与智慧，能帮助丁火在职场中更容易升职。</li><li>西方（金）：西方的能量能带来贵人运，让丁火在关键时刻得到支持与助力。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
